  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Adobe Firefly is Adobe’s generative model family for images, vectors, and (on higher credits) video — integrated with Photoshop, Express, and Firefly web. Free includes a small credit allotment. Standalone Standard is commonly listed around $9.99/mo and Pro around $19.99/mo with premium credit pools; Creative Cloud Pro bundles Firefly credits for designers already in Adobe apps. Commercial IP posture and indemnification are the buying reason vs Midjourney for many brands.",
    "bestFor": [
      "Designers already in Photoshop / Creative Cloud",
      "Brands that need commercial IP posture",
      "Teams that want Firefly + Express without Discord",
